+
+## Risk Assessment (HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW)
+## Candidate Comparison
+## Affected Code Paths
+## Implicit Contracts at Risk
+## Compatibility Matrix
+## Recommended Safeguards
+## Required Regression Tests
